sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant System
    participant Database as Locker Database
    participant Payment as Payment Terminal
    participant Hardware as Hardware Controller

    activate Customer

    Customer->>+System: Enters pickup code
    deactivate Customer
    System->>+Database: Requests package details

    break Invalid Code (3b)
        Database-->>-System: Returns Not Found / Expired
        System-->>+Customer: Shows error: Invalid Code
        deactivate System
        deactivate Customer
    end

    activate System
    activate Database
    Database-->>-System: Returns door number and fee amount

    opt Overdue Fee > 0.00€ (3a)
        System-->>+Customer: Prompts for payment
        deactivate System
        Customer->>+Payment: Taps credit card
        deactivate Customer
            
        break Payment Declined (3a4a)
            Payment-->>-System: Reports payment declined
            activate System
            System-->>+Customer: Shows error: Payment Failed
            deactivate System
        end
        activate Payment
        Payment-->>+System: Confirms successful payment
        deactivate Payment
    end

    System->>+Hardware: Commands to open specified door

    alt Hardware Door Jam (5a)
        Hardware-->>-System: Reports failure to open door
        System-->>+Customer: Shows error: Hardware Error
        deactivate Customer
        opt If fee was paid (5a3)
            System->>Payment: Commands to void transaction
        end
        deactivate System
    else Door Opens Successfully
        activate System
        activate Hardware
        Hardware-->>-System: Confirms door is open
        System->>+Database: Updates package status to "Picked Up"
        deactivate Database
        System-->>+Customer: Shows success message: Door is open
        deactivate System
        deactivate Customer
end